[Script Info]Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.709PlayResX: 1920PlayResY: 1080[V4+ Styles]Format: Name, Fontname, Fontsize, PrimaryColour, SecondaryColour, OutlineColour, BackColour, Bold, Italic, Underline, StrikeOut, ScaleX, ScaleY, Spacing, Angle, BorderStyle, Outline, Shadow, Alignment, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, EncodingStyle: Main-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Flashbacks-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.2,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Secondary-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00D6D6D6,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Title-207+,M+ ıc,95,&H00FEFEFE,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.5,0,2,15,15,360,1Style: Credits-207+,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,60,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,1.5,0,1,3.8,0,7,15,15,15,1Style: Thoughts-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.2,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Narrator-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,8,300,300,27,1Style: Captions-207+,Impress BT Pace,56,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,15,15,30,1Style: Lyrics-OP5,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,57,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00060606,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,1,0,1,4,0,2,33,33,27,1Style: Karaoke-OP5,Duality,90,&H000090FF,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,15,15,15,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 10,0:02:06.81,0:02:09.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh! It's gonna eat me! Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.77,0:02:10.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eat this!Dialogue: 10,0:02:26.68,0:02:30.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Outta the way, Iceburg!Dialogue: 10,0:02:34.25,0:02:37.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um?! What the hell are you doing, Franky?!Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.97,0:02:44.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Idiot!Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.59,0:02:44.18,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow!Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.18,0:02:45.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um!Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.43,0:02:47.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?! You're no help at all!Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.94,0:02:50.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All you do is build dangerous crap!Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.14,0:02:51.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.24,0:02:53.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's none of your business, Dumburg!Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.44,0:02:57.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is my favorite battleship, Battle Franky!Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.65,0:03:00.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care! Just get rid of 'em all before someone gets hurt!Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.97,0:03:02.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can build anything I want here!Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.67,0:03:04.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Scrap Island!Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.28,0:03:05.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just you wait.Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.15,0:03:08.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My next battleship will thrash those sea kings!Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.33,0:03:09.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, no chance!Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.60,0:03:10.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll be sea king food!Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.83,0:03:12.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Will not!Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.58,0:03:12.71,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, will too!Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.71,0:03:14.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Will not!Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.33,0:03:14.82,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, will too!Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.82,0:03:16.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.67,0:03:23.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,♪ A man gives his damn all! ♪Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.84,0:03:43.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That wraps up the launch ceremony!Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.27,0:03:46.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've built a damn sturdy ship.Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.74,0:03:48.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haven't we, Yokozuna?Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.17,0:03:48.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ribbit, ribbit!Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.55,0:03:52.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's finish it up tomorrow.Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.02,0:03:53.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Time to head home, boys.Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.65,0:03:54.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ribbit, ribbit!Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.50,0:03:56.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm starving.Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.64,0:03:57.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ribbit, ribbit!Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.43,0:03:58.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's for dinner.Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.96,0:04:00.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ribbit, ribbit!Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.48,0:04:01.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey...Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.29,0:04:03.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, Tom-san!Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.38,0:04:15.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky, what number is your Battle Franky at now?Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.06,0:04:16.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's at eight.Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.11,0:04:17.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was so close this time!Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.69,0:04:18.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Liar!Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.75,0:04:21.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know, Tom-san let's you get away with murder!Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.63,0:04:23.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All you do is build weapons!Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.58,0:04:25.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up, Dumburg!Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.32,0:04:29.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What'd you say to me, Lame-ky?!Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.58,0:04:32.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Idiot...Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.86,0:04:34.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, boys.Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.10,0:04:35.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting already, you two.Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.83,0:04:38.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– But Kokoro-san, he started it! – But Kokoro-san, he started it!Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.04,0:04:41.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh my seas.Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.02,0:04:43.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And Tom-san, that's enough laughing from you.Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.07,0:04:45.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you?Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.80,0:04:48.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way,Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.00,0:04:51.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard pirates raided another lumber hauler.Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.88,0:04:55.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There've been more pirates than ever since the Pirate King's execution.Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.76,0:04:59.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our city's in trouble. The pirate age has engulfed us.Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.96,0:05:02.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It just feels hopeless.Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.02,0:05:09.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Aqua Laguna floods mean we need to get lumber and iron from other islands.Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.12,0:05:12.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, treacherous seas and pirates hamper trade.Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.91,0:05:16.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Short of work, shipyards jockey for customers,Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.41,0:05:19.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,fights break out, and people lose their jobs.Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.07,0:05:25.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Left unchecked, Water Seven could become a ghost island, waiting to sink into the depths.Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.46,0:05:32.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water Seven made its name in the shipbuilding industry. Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.38,0:05:33.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right.Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.49,0:05:36.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san built those incredible pirate ships!Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.56,0:05:38.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, show me the plans for a pirate ship!Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.02,0:05:44.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you laughing?!Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.49,0:05:45.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky,Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.42,0:05:49.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there's no such thing as pirate ship plans.Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.07,0:05:53.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When sailors hoist their black flag, that's a pirate ship.Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.37,0:05:55.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A ship with a seagull flag is the Navy's.Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.46,0:05:59.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what he wants to build,Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.33,0:06:04.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but a man should be damn proud of the ship he builds!Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.75,0:06:10.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to bed, Tom-san?Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.49,0:06:12.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you drawing?Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.88,0:06:13.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well,Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.86,0:06:16.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,this'll give the island hope.Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.14,0:06:18.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hope?Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.42,0:06:22.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This idea might just revitalize Water Seven yet.Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.20,0:06:24.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go on to bed now.Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.41,0:06:26.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.95,0:06:27.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.85,0:06:49.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A government judicial ship is here!Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.05,0:06:51.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's a judicial ship?Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.14,0:06:52.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a mobile courthouse.Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.89,0:06:54.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So who's on trial?Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.56,0:07:00.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.55,0:07:02.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What did Tom-san do? Get the hell outta my way!Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.93,0:07:04.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give Tom-san back, you jerks!Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.52,0:07:08.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Don't worry.Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.20,0:07:12.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san!Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.57,0:07:15.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san!Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.87,0:07:24.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By building the Oro Jackson,Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.04,0:07:28.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the pirate ship of recently executed Pirate King Gold Roger,Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.67,0:07:32.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom the Shipwright was complicit in global piracy.Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.14,0:07:30.54,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry!Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.45,0:07:35.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For his crime, Tom will be taken to Enies Lobby...Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.39,0:07:36.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,where...Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.56,0:07:38.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he will be put to death!Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.60,0:07:40.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.02,0:07:41.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Terrible news!Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.60,0:07:44.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom... Tom received a death sentence!Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.64,0:07:48.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They say building the Pirate King's ship was a crime.Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.53,0:07:49.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's finally happened.Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.65,0:07:51.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The world's a mess.Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.65,0:07:52.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was coming to him.Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.41,0:07:59.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Normally, it would not be a crime for a shipwright to sell their ship to anyone.Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.09,0:08:01.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, the Pirate King warrants an exception.Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.37,0:08:07.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyone deemed to have anything to do with his piracy poses a danger to the world.Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.85,0:08:09.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thus, I sentence you to death!Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.56,0:08:11.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take the convict away!Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.36,0:08:11.84,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Honor!Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.84,0:08:13.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go.Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.22,0:08:14.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move it!Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.12,0:08:17.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, get moving!Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.61,0:08:19.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.01,0:08:20.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm...Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.46,0:08:20.77,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.18,0:08:26.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,envisioning a steam-powered paddle ship that could bang along tracks in the sea.Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.65,0:08:29.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Don't speak to him!Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.15,0:08:30.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get...Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.57,0:08:31.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As we speak,Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.99,0:08:36.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,this island decays due to stagnant trade.Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.67,0:08:37.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As we speak,Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.10,0:08:44.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the people are demoralized by their fear that the island will sink.Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.46,0:08:51.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Launching a sea train will surely save our island, Water Seven!Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.38,0:08:55.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E-Excuse us. We will remove him immediately.Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.82,0:08:57.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, wait a moment.Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.32,0:08:57.93,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.93,0:09:00.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You said, “a sea train”?Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.97,0:09:06.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A ship puffing down its tracks, going from island to island.Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.77,0:09:11.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Carrying passengers, goods, and other ships without being fazed by the weather,Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.53,0:09:15.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a sea train would allow everyone free passage across the sea.Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.17,0:09:16.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds too good to be true.Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.70,0:09:20.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tracks? They would be destroyed by the first Aqua Laguna.Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.82,0:09:22.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.02,0:09:24.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not to mention the sea kings!Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.48,0:09:27.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seaborne tracks wouldn't need to be fixed.Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.23,0:09:33.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bobbing just below the surface, never resisting the surf,Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.09,0:09:38.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the tracks would act as a guide, with the sea train using them as a rope.Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.26,0:09:40.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, I'm designing a noisemakerDialogue: 10,0:09:40.62,0:09:45.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to drive away fish using the space between the tracks and the paddle.Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.98,0:09:50.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Such a device would keep the sea kings away from the tracks.Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.23,0:09:51.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Would something like that work?Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.54,0:09:56.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By uniting Saint Poplar, Pucci, San Faldo, and Water Seven,Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.86,0:10:00.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we can grow our industries through mutual trade.Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.70,0:10:01.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brilliant!Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.74,0:10:07.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I should finish the blueprints soon, but it's not a job for just any shipwright.Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.25,0:10:10.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What about a stop at Enies Lobby?Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.17,0:10:12.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No problem!Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.11,0:10:18.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we perfect this technology and spread it across the seas,Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.21,0:10:21.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it would damn well change relations among the world's islands.Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.68,0:10:25.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The sea train is the hope of Water Seven!Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.35,0:10:27.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How long would it take?Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.81,0:10:29.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ten years.Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.27,0:10:30.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then show us what you can do!Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.98,0:10:33.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom the Shipwright,Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.06,0:10:38.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hereby give you a ten-year reprieve to develop the sea train!Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.74,0:10:41.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Impressive!Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.56,0:10:43.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Tom!Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.45,0:10:46.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Save Water Seven!Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.37,0:10:51.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn, I'm alive!Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.54,0:10:54.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no laughing matter, Tom-san!Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.00,0:10:57.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A chill ran down my spine at the thought of what was to come.Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.76,0:11:02.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But now, assuming everything goes well, they might drop the case concerning Roger.Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.18,0:11:05.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, I gotta say, you're amazing, Tom-san!Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.56,0:11:09.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone was blown away by your idea!Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.27,0:11:10.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know the sea tr–Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.35,0:11:12.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food!Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.39,0:11:14.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yokozuna, you're learning the front crawl.Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.27,0:11:15.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ribbit!Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.44,0:11:18.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell, Franky?! You've been sulking since we got home.Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.99,0:11:20.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.40,0:11:22.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm pissed off! Everything's crap!Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.24,0:11:26.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger's ship is the only one in the world to circumnavigate the Grand Line!Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.48,0:11:29.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After making an incredible ship like that, why does Tom-san deserve death?!Dialogue: 10,0:11:29.91,0:11:32.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those idiot onlookers act like it's only natural,Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.83,0:11:34.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but they can't even build one ship!Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.92,0:11:36.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know what's going on!Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.56,0:11:38.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This office is under this bridgeDialogue: 10,0:11:38.25,0:11:41.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,just because the city forced us down here after Roger's execution!Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.26,0:11:45.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why does the world's best shipwright have to deal with this crap?!Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.14,0:11:49.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's so funny, you horned tanuki?!Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.54,0:11:50.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get off him, Lame-ky!Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.96,0:11:52.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't stand for it!Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.02,0:11:54.57,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,And I won't stand for him dying!Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.61,0:12:00.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, no. That's all wrong!Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.82,0:12:03.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Push the water as far back as you can!Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.45,0:12:06.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ribbit! Ribbit!Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.81,0:12:08.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it!Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.08,0:12:09.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have to stroke harder!Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.70,0:12:11.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is with him?Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.80,0:12:13.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should just kick that idiot out!Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.79,0:12:17.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't say that. He's a part of our team.Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.92,0:12:22.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His skills are already nearly at the level of the other shipwrights here.Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.30,0:12:24.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His creations are a bit dangerous though.Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.55,0:12:28.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's always been a straight shooter.Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.89,0:12:37.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This kid damn well showed up on Scrap Island two years ago.Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.52,0:12:40.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He surprised me with the cannons he made from junk.Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.24,0:12:45.36,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Take me in, old man! My parents abandoned me!Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.70,0:12:50.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said his parents threw him off their ship because they couldn't handle him.Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.97,0:12:54.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a bit like one of those lousy pirates!Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.20,0:12:57.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's hilarious!Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.19,0:12:57.08,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san...Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.08,0:12:59.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's tough.Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.61,0:13:02.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Still, he's a good kid.Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.55,0:13:07.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You two will surely be world-class shipwrights someday.Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.22,0:13:09.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should get along with him.Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.04,0:13:10.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's impossible for Franky.Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.86,0:13:12.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every fiber of him is crazy.Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.94,0:13:18.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, once the plans are ready, we'll start building the sea train!Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.04,0:13:18.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure.Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.95,0:13:21.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But there's no way he'll help us.Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.07,0:13:25.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's welcome to do as he likes.Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.69,0:15:02.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Suicide?Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.84,0:15:05.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard he was the president of Dock 4 Shipbuilding.Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.97,0:15:07.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It must have been because of that accident.Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.54,0:15:12.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They didn't have enough supplies, so he took his own ship to buy lumber.Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.42,0:15:14.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He got 50 people killed.Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.19,0:15:17.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard they're closing the shipyard.Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.43,0:15:20.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,People are so fragile...Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.46,0:15:24.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this island done for already?Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.31,0:15:25.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.86,0:15:29.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you guys hear about Scrap Island?Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.55,0:15:31.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh, no way!Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.69,0:15:32.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that true?!Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.99,0:15:36.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom's Workers finished the sea train?!Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.37,0:15:39.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow! Will this ship really run?!Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.91,0:15:42.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be dangerous. A criminal made it.Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.75,0:15:44.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want to ride.Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.15,0:15:45.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then... I guess I will too.Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.29,0:15:46.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom, do you have any comment?Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.96,0:15:49.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're leaving. All aboard!Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.26,0:15:57.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's moving!Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.55,0:16:00.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The paddles are sticking to the tracks!Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.06,0:16:02.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's moving!Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.33,0:16:04.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow! Look at it go!Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.21,0:16:18.42,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Twelve years ago,Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.42,0:16:25.04,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,for the first time in history, the disheartened people of an isolated, dying city...Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.01,0:16:34.59,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,boarded the sea train Puffing Tom and crossed the sea.Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.27,0:16:44.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.98,0:16:52.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This dingy warehouse was once the headquarters for the shipbuilding company Tom's Workers?Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.84,0:16:54.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A shipbuilding company?Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.04,0:16:59.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom, Iceburg, and Cutty Flam.Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.10,0:17:04.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So this is where the three of you spent so much of your time building ships.Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.46,0:17:10.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Calling it a “secret hideout” is rather endearing.Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.67,0:17:12.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut your hole.Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.55,0:17:14.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get the hell outta here already!Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.63,0:17:19.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll go once we get what we came for, shipwright Cutty Flam.Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.80,0:17:21.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There aren't any blueprints here!Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.77,0:17:26.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, that's the answer I'd expect.Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.52,0:17:29.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.19,0:17:29.23,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalifa!Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.30,0:17:34.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow...Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.32,0:17:40.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eek! Wh-Wh-Wh-What do I do?!Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.75,0:17:46.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastard...Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.32,0:17:49.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got plenty of time to get the truth out of you.Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.84,0:17:52.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have a trump card.Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.55,0:17:55.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It may have happened eight years ago,Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.25,0:17:58.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but it seems you're also guilty of some crimes,Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.76,0:18:00.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,just like Tom.Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.43,0:18:01.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Screw you!Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.77,0:18:03.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san was not a criminal!Dialogue: 10,0:18:03.43,0:18:05.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't talk to me like you know anything about it,Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.89,0:18:07.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you little punk!Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.06,0:18:18.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san!Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.69,0:18:21.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay right there!Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.45,0:18:23.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Calm down.Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.99,0:18:29.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As a criminal, you should know the consequences of your actions.Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.66,0:18:31.54,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky,Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.54,0:18:34.76,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,you have no say in what happens next.Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.76,0:18:36.74,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep your mouth shut!Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.74,0:18:39.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You punks know...Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.27,0:18:41.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,nothing...Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.05,0:18:47.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,about Tom-san and Water Seven!Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.55,0:19:00.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So the judicial ship will be here in three days?Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.57,0:19:03.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, Tom's trial.Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.08,0:19:04.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder how it'll turn out.Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.87,0:19:06.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He should be fine.Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.58,0:19:07.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surely.Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.25,0:19:10.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He followed through on his promise.Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.60,0:19:11.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indubitably.Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.17,0:19:17.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Carry this load to the dock.Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.79,0:19:20.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How'd the negotiations with Saint Poplar go?Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.55,0:19:22.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not good.Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.05,0:19:25.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're looking to take advantage of our lack of resources.Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.44,0:19:27.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Same with the steel from San Faldo.Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.31,0:19:30.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With supplies so expensive, the shipyards will lose money.Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.27,0:19:33.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Next time, we'll figure something out.Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.66,0:19:35.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! That's right!Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.12,0:19:44.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone's happy to travel to the other islands,Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.41,0:19:47.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but trading with them seems to be tricky.Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.18,0:19:50.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At this rate, will the city improve at all?Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.79,0:19:55.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At least the people are buzzing.Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.37,0:19:58.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Results don't happen overnight, Iceburg.Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.55,0:20:03.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do all you can do and be damn proud of it.Dialogue: 10,0:20:03.91,0:20:04.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alright.Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.49,0:20:16.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hello and good day, sir.Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.20,0:20:19.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Would you happen to be the master shipwright Mister Tom?Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.81,0:20:22.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, how I've looked for you!Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.11,0:20:23.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.32,0:20:26.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, but I have a matter to–Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.55,0:20:26.20,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh...Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.20,0:20:28.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't interrupt me! Stand down!Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.14,0:20:28.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.75,0:20:32.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have a matter to dis–Dialogue: 10,0:20:35.75,0:20:38.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I am...Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.43,0:20:41.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cipher Pol Number 5's...Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.66,0:20:42.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spandam!Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.76,0:20:44.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spandam-san!Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.51,0:20:49.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! Sorry 'bout that!Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.72,0:20:53.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are, but it looks like my cannon salute hit you.Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.19,0:20:56.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That aside, I feel super!Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.54,0:21:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Battle Franky 35 is back!Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.00,0:21:01.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I killed a sea king!Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.40,0:21:03.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at how big it is!Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.18,0:21:05.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This monster's gotta be at least 100 meters!Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.99,0:21:10.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That idiot's at it again.Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.57,0:21:16.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! Stop it, Jerkburg!Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.38,0:21:19.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you?!Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.06,0:21:22.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You keep building these damn battleships one after another!Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.63,0:21:24.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enough is enough already!Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.09,0:21:28.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you can't handle it, then today's the day I'll dismantle it for you!Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.24,0:21:29.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Screw you!Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.01,0:21:30.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is my special battleship!Dialogue: 10,0:21:30.98,0:21:33.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way I'd let you do something like that!Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.55,0:21:35.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, listen up, Franky!Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.48,0:21:38.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You killed a sea king, right?Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.08,0:21:40.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means this is a deadly weapon.Dialogue: 10,0:21:40.11,0:21:44.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't understand how you can leave dozens of these things lying around.Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.19,0:21:47.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not like I'm attacking people!Dialogue: 10,0:21:47.66,0:21:49.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not about your intentions!Dialogue: 10,0:21:49.73,0:21:52.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's your culpability for creating such weapons, Lame-ky!Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.88,0:21:55.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,W-Wait...Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.62,0:22:00.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san, say something!Dialogue: 10,0:22:00.46,0:22:03.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lame-ky is a disgrace to our company!Dialogue: 10,0:22:03.05,0:22:04.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're back to Lame-ky?!Dialogue: 10,0:22:06.98,0:22:09.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,W-Wait just a minute, please!Dialogue: 10,0:22:09.43,0:22:11.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First, I would like an apology.Dialogue: 10,0:22:11.45,0:22:13.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, I would like you to hear me out!Dialogue: 10,0:22:13.97,0:22:16.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're with the government?Dialogue: 10,0:22:16.45,0:22:18.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this about my trial?Dialogue: 10,0:22:18.06,0:22:20.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you talking about?Dialogue: 10,0:22:20.90,0:22:24.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, sir, I don't know anything about that.Dialogue: 10,0:22:24.03,0:22:25.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 10,0:22:28.36,0:22:29.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's Tom-san?Dialogue: 10,0:22:29.87,0:22:32.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They wanted to talk alone.Dialogue: 10,0:22:32.69,0:22:35.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's in the brick warehouse with some government guy.Dialogue: 10,0:22:35.80,0:22:38.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Span... What was it again?Dialogue: 10,0:22:38.20,0:22:40.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spanda... something or other.Dialogue: 10,0:22:40.08,0:22:43.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds like he's not affiliated with the judicial ship.Dialogue: 10,0:22:43.48,0:22:46.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're not very well organized.Dialogue: 10,0:22:49.07,0:22:52.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know! I don't have any blueprints like that!Dialogue: 10,0:22:53.56,0:22:54.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nonsense!Dialogue: 10,0:22:54.90,0:22:57.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't try acting humble and playing dumbbell with me!Dialogue: 10,0:22:57.71,0:23:00.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've already combed through Water Seven's past!Dialogue: 10,0:23:00.90,0:23:04.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we search the premises, we'll find them in no time!Dialogue: 10,0:23:06.88,0:23:09.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you have a warrant to search me?Dialogue: 10,0:23:10.55,0:23:12.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I could get one, Tom.Dialogue: 10,0:23:12.69,0:23:18.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I already know you're the master criminal who built Gold Roger's ship!Dialogue: 10,0:23:18.25,0:23:22.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As a criminal, your freedom remains solely at my mercy.Dialogue: 10,0:23:22.56,0:23:25.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, the government already knows all about that.Dialogue: 10,0:23:25.60,0:23:26.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 10,0:23:26.46,0:23:28.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's absurd!Dialogue: 10,0:23:28.47,0:23:32.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So why are you free to work as a shipwright here?!Dialogue: 10,0:23:32.93,0:23:36.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do as an intelligence agent does and figure it out. So long!Dialogue: 10,0:23:38.74,0:23:40.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! I'm not done with you yet!Dialogue: 10,0:23:40.89,0:23:42.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you know who I am?!Dialogue: 10,0:23:45.91,0:23:47.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that?Dialogue: 10,0:23:47.86,0:23:52.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom followed through on the promise he made on the judicial ship.Dialogue: 10,0:23:52.16,0:23:56.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The charges should be dropped when he's tried in three days.Dialogue: 10,0:23:56.01,0:23:58.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom's a great man.Dialogue: 10,0:23:58.41,0:24:00.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding.Dialogue: 10,0:24:00.92,0:24:04.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They'll drop the charges for his involvement with Roger?Dialogue: 10,0:24:04.69,0:24:08.76,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,So they do exist?Dialogue: 10,0:24:08.76,0:24:09.81,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.Dialogue: 10,0:24:09.81,0:24:12.91,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Naturally, pirates are also ferreting about for these blueprints.Dialogue: 10,0:24:12.91,0:24:16.78,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,In the unlikely event they were to fall into nongovernmental hands,Dialogue: 10,0:24:16.78,0:24:20.06,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,the government would no longer have a fighting chance.Dialogue: 10,0:24:20.06,0:24:24.18,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,It has been 10 years since the start of the so-called Great Pirate Era.Dialogue: 10,0:24:24.18,0:24:28.02,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirates have only grown more powerful and more numerous.Dialogue: 10,0:24:28.02,0:24:32.89,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,We cannot stand idly by while the ancient weapons are revived!Dialogue: 10,0:24:32.89,0:24:36.37,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Those of us who stand for justice should have that kind of firepower!Dialogue: 10,0:24:36.37,0:24:41.54,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,If we took possession of the ancient weapon, we could bring the Great Pirate Era to an end!Dialogue: 10,0:24:43.33,0:24:47.54,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You have a point that the times are changing.Dialogue: 10,0:24:47.54,0:24:52.92,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,First get us those blueprints, then we'll talk more.Dialogue: 10,0:24:52.92,0:24:56.51,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,We're leaving this matter to you, Spandam.Dialogue: 10,0:24:56.51,0:24:59.15,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I am honored! You won't regret it.Dialogue: 10,0:25:00.06,0:25:02.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all this investigative work,Dialogue: 10,0:25:02.01,0:25:06.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there's no chance in hell I'm letting this opportunity slip by!Dialogue: 10,0:25:10.74,0:25:11.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 10,0:25:15.03,0:25:16.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it!Dialogue: 10,0:25:16.60,0:25:20.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm up a creek if he's exonerated!Dialogue: 10,0:25:20.99,0:25:21.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spandam-san!Dialogue: 10,0:25:28.33,0:25:30.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forget the charges getting dropped.Dialogue: 10,0:25:30.13,0:25:31.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just you watch, you smug bastard.Dialogue: 10,0:25:32.88,0:25:36.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, call in five more agents!Dialogue: 10,0:25:36.08,0:25:36.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 10,0:25:42.25,0:25:44.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spandam-san!Dialogue: 10,0:25:47.07,0:25:48.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg. Franky.Dialogue: 10,0:25:48.78,0:25:49.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 10,0:25:49.45,0:25:51.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come here for a second.Dialogue: 10,0:25:51.65,0:25:54.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need to give you something important.Dialogue: 10,0:25:58.17,0:26:01.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why would someone design this?!Dialogue: 10,0:26:01.59,0:26:05.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C-Can humans build something like this?!Dialogue: 10,0:26:05.33,0:26:09.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the worst monstrosity in the history of shipbuilding.Dialogue: 10,0:26:09.29,0:26:11.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The government is aware of these blueprints' existence.Dialogue: 10,0:26:11.96,0:26:13.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're already moving in.Dialogue: 10,0:26:13.53,0:26:15.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous for me to keep them.Dialogue: 10,0:26:15.80,0:26:17.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm scared, but...Dialogue: 10,0:26:17.59,0:26:20.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I understand. I'll take them.Dialogue: 10,0:26:20.22,0:26:22.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Awesome, Iceburg! Hey!Dialogue: 10,0:26:22.97,0:26:25.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should build it!Dialogue: 10,0:26:25.10,0:26:26.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You idiot!Dialogue: 10,0:26:26.28,0:26:28.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That hurt!Dialogue: 10,0:26:28.39,0:26:30.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think before you speak!Dialogue: 10,0:26:30.34,0:26:32.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of these.Dialogue: 10,0:26:32.06,0:26:34.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we let something like this come into being...Dialogue: 10,0:26:35.38,0:26:36.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 10,0:26:39.16,0:26:41.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the world would be doomed.Dialogue: 10,0:26:46.37,0:26:50.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's up to you two what you do with those.Dialogue: 10,0:26:50.26,0:26:51.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If push comes to shove, destroy 'em.Dialogue: 10,0:26:51.96,0:26:53.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom-san.Dialogue: 10,0:26:53.46,0:26:55.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,While we're at it,Dialogue: 10,0:26:56.06,0:26:58.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need to share one other cause for concern.Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.59,0:01:59.39,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,The Legendary ShipwrightDialogue: 1,0:01:54.59,0:01:59.39,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,The Legendary ShipwrightDialogue: 0,0:01:51.80,0:01:54.30,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Water Seven, 22 Years AgoDialogue: 1,0:01:51.80,0:01:54.30,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Water Seven, 22 Years AgoDialogue: 1,0:02:44.23,0:02:47.94,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg 16 Years OldDialogue: 2,0:02:44.23,0:02:47.94,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg 16 Years OldDialogue: 0,0:02:50.19,0:02:53.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Cutty Flam (Franky) 12 Years OldDialogue: 1,0:02:50.19,0:02:53.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Cutty Flam (Franky) 12 Years OldDialogue: 0,0:03:38.36,0:03:46.75,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,President Tom (Longhorn Cowfish Fishman) Tom's Workers ShipbuildingDialogue: 1,0:03:38.36,0:03:46.75,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,President Tom (Longhorn Cowfish Fishman) Tom's Workers ShipbuildingDialogue: 0,0:03:46.79,0:03:48.96,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Yokozuna (Sumo Frog) Tom's PetDialogue: 1,0:03:46.79,0:03:48.96,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Yokozuna (Sumo Frog) Tom's PetDialogue: 0,0:03:54.55,0:03:59.68,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Opposite the Warehouse Under the Bridge Water SevenDialogue: 1,0:03:54.55,0:03:59.68,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Opposite the Warehouse Under the Bridge Water SevenDialogue: 0,0:03:59.72,0:04:03.81,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Scrap Island (Tom's Workers Dockyard)Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.72,0:04:03.81,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Scrap Island (Tom's Workers Dockyard)Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.38,0:04:44.56,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Kokoro, a Beautiful Secretary Tom's WorkersDialogue: 1,0:04:38.38,0:04:44.56,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Kokoro, a Beautiful Secretary Tom's WorkersDialogue: 0,0:18:47.98,0:18:51.44,Captions-207+,